/*
  Localizable.strings (es)

  FAHYBRIK — Spanish (Castilian, tú-informal). DEFAULT locale.

  Voice: spare, precise, no motivational filler. Coach-shorthand mid-sentence
  is fine. Sport vocabulary brand-locked: HYROX, AMRAP, EMOM, RPE, Z1-Z5,
  sled push, wall ball, ski erg, Z2, Z3, etc. — never translated.

  Anchor phrases:
    - "Entrenar al detalle."
    - "Cuanto más sepa Pablo, más preciso será tu plan."
    - "Pablo está armando tu plan."

  Glyphs allowed: ▶ ✓ ✗ ▲ ▼ · → ← " " ○ ●     NO emoji ever.
*/

